[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4153264730","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13742#issuecomment-4153264730","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13742","id":4153264730,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM73jcpa","user":{"login":"anttijk","id":23225331,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMjI1MzMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/23225331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk","html_url":"https://github.com/anttijk","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/anttijk/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-30T08:37:38Z","updated_at":"2026-03-30T08:37:38Z","body":"Implementation would be bit simpler if they are consistently not allowed in any properties.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4153264730/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4614701512","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13742#issuecomment-4614701512","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13742","id":4614701512,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABEw7ByA","user":{"login":"tabatkins","id":682840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4Mjg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/682840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins","html_url":"https://github.com/tabatkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-03T16:44:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-03T16:44:03Z","body":"That test is setting `--x` (an unregistered property) to the value `src(attr(data-foo))`. Because it's unregistered, *there is no URL there*. All the CSS engine sees is the value `████attr(data-foo)████`. Substitution succeeds as normal there, resulting in `████\"https://does-not-exist.test/404.png\"████`, with that string attr-tainted. Totally fine.\n\nThen when you *use* that value, parsing and interpreting the full `src(\"https://does-not-exist.test/404.png\")`, you run into the security restrictions:\n\n* functions that contain an [attr()-tainted](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#attr-taint) value are themselves attr-tainted (`src()` contains an attr-tainted `<string-token>`)\n* Using an [attr()-tainted](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-values-5/#attr-taint) value *as a `<url>`* makes a declaration IACVT (the tainted `src()` is indeed a `<url>`)\n\nSo the WPT is correct per spec, and matches my intention. Following your suggestion would require us to introduce new concepts to the Variables spec, where unregistered properties *partially* interpret the uninterpreted token segments of their value to determine what parts are \"actually\" a `<url>`.\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/4614701512/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/5124190418","html_url":"https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13742#issuecomment-5124190418","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/13742","id":5124190418,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAI0trM8AAAABMWzw0g","user":{"login":"tabatkins","id":682840,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4Mjg0MA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/682840?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins","html_url":"https://github.com/tabatkins","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tabatkins/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-29T22:51:50Z","updated_at":"2026-07-29T22:51:50Z","body":"@anttijk Did my comment sufficiently resolve your question?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/comments/5124190418/reactions","t